    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_WelcomeHello">Welcome to Kippix</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_WelcomeHelloText">A console-style home for all your games. This takes a minute: your name, a few tips, and two optional extras. Everything here can be changed later in Settings &amp; Customisation.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_WelcomeStart">Let's start</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_WelcomeSkip">Skip the welcome</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_WelcomeSkipSub">Straight to your games</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_WelcomeYou">Who are you?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_WelcomeYouText">Your name and picture show in the top left. Press it for your profile, achievements, the Store and more.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_WelcomeName">Name: {0}</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_WelcomeNameSub"></sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_WelcomePicSub">PNG or JPG, or keep your Windows picture</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_WelcomeProfiles">Who else plays?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_WelcomeProfilesOff">Profiles let everyone on this PC have their own layout, favourites and Steam account, with Kids and Guest too. They're being tested: switch them on in the helper's settings (desktop mode) to try them.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_WelcomeProfilesText">Each person gets their own layout, favourites and Steam account. You're the first; add anyone else who plays (Kids hides games above an age rating; Guest is always there).</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_WelcomeTips">How editing works</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_WelcomeTipsText">Almost everything on screen can be moved, sized, switched off or swapped. A few ways in:</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_Tip1">Hold A on a game: Free move</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_Tip1Sub">Move, resize or change any part of the screen</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_Tip2">⋯ at the top: Settings &amp; Customisation</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_Tip2Sub">Every setting, with a search to find one quickly</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_Tip3">Hold X on a card: keep it in that spot</sys:String>
