    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_DocOfferText">Kippix didn't start properly the last {0} times. Safe mode switches off widgets, the carousel and folders, live backgrounds, the in-game overlay and animations until you turn it off again (Settings › Help › Kippix Doctor).</sys:String>
