    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_SecLiveBg">LIVE BACKGROUND</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_LiveTrailerHelp">When a game stays highlighted for a moment, its trailer fades in over its art, muted and looping (the same trailers as the game page). No trailer: the art stays. It pauses while a menu or the game page covers it, and while a game runs.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_LiveSlidesHelp">When a game stays highlighted for a moment, its pictures take turns every 8 seconds: its background, your screenshots of it and, for Steam games, the store's screenshots.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_LiveSlideWeb">Store screenshots too</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_LiveSlideWebSub">Adds Steam store screenshots to the slideshow</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_DocTitle">Kippix Doctor</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtHint">Any button hides this   ·   Tips can be switched off in Settings › Help</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtReset">Tips will show again, the next time each screen opens.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtHome">Your home screen</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtHomeText">Hold A on a game to move or resize anything (Free edit). Y searches; ⋯ at the top has every setting.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtGame">The game page</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtGameText">Press X on a part for its settings, hold A to move things around, and go down for more about the game.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtFree">Free edit</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtFreeText">Point at anything with the D-pad. A picks it up to move it, Y sizes it, X opens its settings, View deletes it. B when you're done.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtBoardEdit">Editing the board</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtBoardEditText">A adds a tile or picks one up, X opens its settings, Y removes it. B when you're done.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtBoard">The Board</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtBoardText">Hold A on a tile to edit the board: tiles of any size, widgets and pages.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtFolders">Folders</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtFoldersText">Folders gather your games. Make more in Settings › Home settings › Game cards and layout › Your folders.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtStore">The Store</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtStoreText">Y searches, X puts a game on your wishlist, LT / RT jump a screen at a time. Prices from every store are on each game's page.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtHub">Your profile</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtHubText">LB / RB switch tabs (library, friends, wishlist, your year…); LT / RT change the month or year.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtAch">Achievements</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtAchText">Y searches; on a game's achievements LB / RB step through them one at a time.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtGallery">Gallery</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtGalleryText">X marks a favourite, Y picks several at once, LB / RB step through them full screen.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtSearch">Search</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtSearchText">Type with the on-screen keyboard (or a real one): the results show as you type.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtSettings">Settings &amp; Customisation</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_FtSettingsText">Search settings at the top finds any setting. Help has Kippix Doctor if something goes wrong.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourFinish">Start playing</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourStep">Step {0} of {1}</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourHint">LB / RB  Back / Next</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourHelloText">A console-style home for all your games, made to be yours. A quick setup: a starting look, your stores, who plays, and a controller check. Everything can be changed later in Settings &amp; Customisation.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourSkip">Skip the tour</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourSkipSub">Go straight to your games</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourLook">Pick a starting look</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourLookText">How your games sit on the home screen: it changes behind this as you pick. Try them all; Settings › Home settings › Game cards and layout has many more ways to tune it, and Layouts &amp; reset has other people's layouts.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourRow">Row</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourRowSub">Covers in a row with full-screen art</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTall">Tall cards</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTallSub">Big portrait panels across the screen</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourFull">Full Screen</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourFullSub">One big card in the middle</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourGridSub">Rows of covers that scroll down</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourList">List</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourListSub">Games down one side with play time</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourBoardSub">Tiles of any size: games, widgets, pages</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourFolderSub">Folder tiles, each with its own games</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourAccent">Colours from the game's art</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourAccentSub">The highlight colour comes from the selected game</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourStores">Your game stores</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourStoresText">Your games come from Playnite's library add-ons. Here's which are signed in. Choose one to open that add-on's own settings and sign in (a mouse, touch or keyboard is easiest there).</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourNoStores">No store add-ons yet</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourNoStoresSub">Add them in desktop mode under Add-ons › Libraries</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourNoArt">Most of your games have no pictures yet</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourNoArtSub">In desktop mode: Playnite's menu › Library › Download metadata. Covers, backgrounds and genres come from it (Kippix's layouts and More like this need them).</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourChecking">checking…</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourSignedIn">signed in</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourSignedOut">not signed in</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourWorking">working</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourUnknown">couldn't tell</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourGames">{0} games</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourSteamStoreSub">For the Store's wishlist</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourDesktop">Set up stores in desktop mode</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourDesktopSub">Switches to desktop mode; the tour returns next time</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourStoresNotice">STORES</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourNoSettings">This add-on's settings can only be opened in desktop mode.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourSettingsHint">Sign in here, then Save. With the controller: LB / RB move, A presses, B closes.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourSave">Save</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourProfiles">Who plays?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourYouText">Your name and picture show in the top left: press it for your profile, achievements, the Store and more.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourProfilesOff">Profiles for everyone who plays</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourProfilesOffSub">Each person's own layout and favourites (in testing)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourProfilesHeader">PROFILES</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourAddSub">Or skip and add people later in Settings › Profiles</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourPad">Controller check</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourPadText">Press every button: each lights up (the ones you've tried keep an outline). Here A and B are being tested too: Menu (Start) carries on, B twice goes back.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourPadHint">Menu  Next      B twice  Back</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourPadNext">All good: next</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourPadNextSub">Go to the next step</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourSteamPad">Steam Controller found: Steam's extra keyboard copies of each press are taken out for you.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourDoneText">Have fun. Hold A on a game to move or resize anything; ⋯ at the top has every setting. If something ever goes wrong, Settings › Help › Kippix Doctor can check things and make a bug report.</sys:String>
