    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourHelloFoot">A few quick steps  ·  everything can be changed later in Settings &amp; Customisation</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourHelloText2">Your games, on the big screen, the way you like them. Let's get you set up: a look, your stores, who plays and your controller.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourHi1">Made to be yours</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourHi1Text">Layouts, colours, tiles and widgets: almost everything can be changed, and saved as your own layout.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourHi2">Built for controllers</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourHi2Text">Xbox, PlayStation, Switch and Steam Controllers. Hold A on something to move or resize it.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourHi3">Everything in one place</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourHi3Text">Every store's games, achievements, screenshots, your wishlist and friends, from the couch.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourKickLook">YOUR LOOK</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourGoodToKnow">GOOD TO KNOW</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipLook1">Change it any time</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipLook1Text">Your home screen changes behind this as you pick.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipLook2">Board is the most free</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipLook2Text">Tiles of any size: games, widgets and shortcuts. Manual Board adds more pages.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipLook3">Other people's layouts</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipLook3Text">Settings › Layouts &amp; reset, and Settings › Community, have more to try.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourKickStores">YOUR STORES</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipStores1">Your games come from add-ons</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipStores1Text">Playnite's library add-ons bring them in: Steam, Epic, GOG, Xbox and more.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipStores2">A mouse helps here</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipStores2Text">Signing in to an add-on is easiest with a mouse or keyboard, in its own window.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipStores3">The Steam store sign-in</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipStores3Text">Only for the Store page's wishlist and prices; your games don't need it.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourKickProfiles">WHO PLAYS</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipProf1">You, top left</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipProf1Text">Your name and picture: press them for your profile, achievements and the Store.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipProf2">Everyone their own</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipProf2Text">With profiles, each person keeps their own layout, favourites and Steam account.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipProf3">Kids and Guest</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipProf3Text">Kids hides games above an age rating; Guest keeps nothing. A PIN can lock settings.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourKickPad">YOUR CONTROLLER</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipPad1">Press everything</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipPad1Text">Each button lights up as you press it, so you can see they all work.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipPad2">Steam Controller</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipPad2Text">Steam's extra keyboard copies of each press are taken out for you.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipPad3">In a game</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_KX_TourTipPad3Text">The Guide button opens Kippix's overlay: achievements, guides, screenshots and more.</sys:String>
